This ontology fragment represents the classes `Job`, `Affinity`, `CPUBind`, `Distribute`, `Balance`, `Core`, `InTask`, `SMTMode`, `LSB_JOB_SMT_MODE`, `OpenMP`, `Thread`, `MPI`, and the datatype properties `OMP_NUM_THREADS`, `OMP_PROC_BIND`, and `OMP_PLACES`. The relationships between these classes and properties are also defined.
